  {
    "id": "draft-ch07-008",
    "verdict": "needs_edit",
    "issues": [
      "Factual accuracy: Sweden's Discrimination Act (Diskrimineringslagen) recognizes SEVEN protected grounds, not five. The correct option omits 'ålder' (age) and 'könsöverskridande identitet eller uttryck' (gender identity or expression). Presenting an incomplete list as 'the' protected grounds is misleading for a study app.",
      "The explanation also enumerates only the five grounds. Note the Act's wording for religion is 'religion eller annan trosuppfattning'.",
      "Difficulty mislabel: this is pure recall, comparable to the other list questions (025, 026), so 'easy' fits better than 'medium'."
    ],
    "suggestedOptions": [
      "Kön, könsöverskridande identitet eller uttryck, etnisk tillhörighet, religion eller annan trosuppfattning, funktionsnedsättning, sexuell läggning och ålder.",
      "Yrkesval, utbildningsnivå, inkomst och bostadsort.",
      "Politiskt partisamhörighet, medlemskap i fackförbund och fritidsintressen.",
      "Medborgarskapslängd, språkkunskaper i engelska och civilstånd."
    ],
    "suggestedCorrectIndex": 0,
    "suggestedExplanationEn": "Swedish discrimination law protects seven specific grounds: sex, gender identity or expression, ethnic origin, religion or other belief, disability, sexual orientation, and age.",
    "difficultySuggestion": "easy"
  },
